dtruth 11 (Benign or malignant neoplasm): Matches \"The lesion's description as a smooth, regular, and soft mass present since birth, along with its appearance on MRI, suggests a benign congenital tumor such as a congenital granular cell tumor.\"\n- Groundtruth 12 (Cystic lesions): Matches \"The midline location and the partly fatty appearance on MRI could also suggest a dermoid cyst, which is a type of congenital teratoma that can occur in the tongue.\"\n- Groundtruth 13 (Lingual thyroid): No match.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"matching_dict\": {\n    \"1\": [],\n    \"2\": [],\n    \"3\": [],\n    \"4\": [\n      \"The lesion's description as a smooth, regular, and soft mass present since birth, along with its appearance on MRI, suggests a benign congenital tumor such as a congenital granular cell tumor.\"\n    ],\n    \"5\": [],\n    \"6\": [],\n    \"7\": [],\n    \"8\": [],\n    \"9\": [],\n    \"10\": [],\n    \"11\": [\n      \"The lesion's description as a smooth, regular, and soft mass present since birth, along with its appearance on MRI, suggests a benign congenital tumor such as a congenital granular cell tumor.\"\n    ],\n    \"12\": [\n      \"The midline location and the partly fatty appearance on MRI could also suggest a dermoid cyst, which is a type of congenital teratoma that can occur in the tongue.\"\n    ],\n    \"13\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n</diagnostic_comparison>",
