r Groundtruth Reasons 3, 4, and 5, there are no matching statements in the Predicted Diagnostic Reasons.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"matching_dict\": {\n    \"1\": [\n      \"Although less likely, the large size and gradual enlargement of the mass could also suggest a liposarcoma, but the lack of invasion, erosion, or neurovascular impairment makes this less probable.\"\n    ],\n    \"2\": [\n      \"The mass is described as a firm, nonpulsatile, and painless swelling with a density similar to subcutaneous fat on CT scan and fatty-appearing on MRI, which is consistent with a lipoma.\"\n    ],\n    \"3\": [],\n    \"4\": [],\n    \"5\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n</diagnostic_comparison>",
    "prompt_id": "mcr.reasoning_recall"
