 3, there is no match.\n*   For Groundtruth Diagnostic Reason 4, there is no match.\n\nTherefore, the `matching_dict` will contain empty lists for all groundtruth reasons.\n</diagnostic_comparison>\n```json\n{\n  \"matching_dict\": {\n    \"1\": [],\n    \"2\": [],\n    \"3\": [],\n    \"4\": []\n  }\n}\n```",
